{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03543","headline":"出境游山二首 一 · 王勃","name":"出境游山二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"源水终无路，山阿若有人。\n驱羊先动石，走兔欲投巾。\n洞晚秋泉冷，岩朝古树新。\n峰斜连鸟翅，磴叠上鱼鳞。\n化鹤千龄早，元龟六代春。\n浮云今可驾，沧海自成尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}